### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Urban Road with Rolling Ball Indicator" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Rolling ball indicator detected on road surface" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Small metallic object (rolling ball) on road" .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Rolling object may cause sensor occlusion for autonomous vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk with vehicle following too closely in low visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low-light urban environment with artificial lighting" .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
```

